        "$ref": "e84c155142a04fdf994e696e523121ee"
      },
      "name": "AD-02 - Medicine Search & Details",
      "visibility": "public",
      "isAbstract": false,
      "isReadOnly": false,
      "isSingleExecution": false,
      "documentation": "Activity Diagram derived from UC-02 (Search Medicine) and UC-03 (View Medicine Details).\nShows the workflow followed when a Patient or Caregiver searches for a medicine and, when a suitable result is available, selects it to view its structured details.\n\nPreconditions:\n1. The user can access the Medicine Search function.\n2. The MedAccess medicine catalogue is available or potentially accessible.\n3. Authentication is treated as a precondition, not part of this workflow.\n\nPostconditions (success): A matching medicine has been selected and available structured medicine details have been displayed to the user.\nPostconditions (alternative): No matching medicine is found, OR the catalogue is unavailable, OR the selected medicine record/details cannot be retrieved.\n\nTraceability: UC-02 - Search Medicine; UC-03 - View Medicine Details; FR-05-FR-09.",
